---
// Mirrors the Event / Fixed structs and the real output in the post.
---
<figure class="gp14d">
  <div class="gp14d-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 300" role="img" aria-label="Event embeds Todo and time.Time. time.Time has a MarshalJSON method that is promoted to Event, so json.Marshal calls it and prints only the time. With a named field At, the output has id, title and at.">
    <text x="20" y="24" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>An embedded time.Time takes over the JSON</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>time.Time nhúng sẵn chiếm luôn phần JSON</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="44" width="260" height="104" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="36" y="70" class="b">Event</text>
    <text x="36" y="96">Todo <tspan class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>(embedded)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>(nhúng)</tspan></tspan></text>
    <text x="36" y="122" class="r">time.Time <tspan data-lang-en>(embedded)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>(nhúng)</tspan></text>

    <line x1="286" x2="334" y1="96" y2="96" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="342,96 333,91 333,101" class="ah" />

    <rect x="346" y="44" width="534" height="104" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="362" y="70"><tspan data-lang-en>time.Time has a MarshalJSON method, so Event has it too.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>time.Time có method MarshalJSON, nên Event cũng có.</tspan></text>
    <text x="362" y="96"><tspan data-lang-en>json.Marshal finds a type that encodes itself</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>json.Marshal thấy một kiểu tự biết cách encode</tspan></text>
    <text x="362" y="122"><tspan data-lang-en>and never looks at the other fields.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nên không nhìn tới các field còn lại.</tspan></text>

    <text x="20" y="190" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Embedded</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nhúng</tspan></text>
    <rect x="170" y="168" width="710" height="34" rx="6" class="bad" />
    <text x="186" y="190">"2026-11-23T09:30:00Z"</text>
    <text x="520" y="190" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>id and title are gone</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mất id và title</tspan></text>

    <text x="20" y="246" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Named field</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Có đặt tên</tspan></text>
    <rect x="170" y="224" width="710" height="34" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="186" y="246">{'{"id":7,"title":"write post","at":"2026-11-23T09:30:00Z"}'}</text>
    <text x="20" y="284" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Named field: At time.Time. It is encoded like any other field.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Field có tên: At time.Time. Nó được encode như mọi field khác.</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The outputs are the real ones printed by the program in this section.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Các kết quả là kết quả thật do chương trình trong mục này in ra.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp14d { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp14d-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp14d svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp14d text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp14d .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp14d .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp14d .m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp14d .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .gp14d .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp14d .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp14d .own { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gp14d .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp14d .ln { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gp14d .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp14d .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp14d figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
